<section class="section"><div class="container story-hero-grid"><div class="reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Mills Smoke & Grill · Est. 2026</span><h2 class="display display--lg">Born for the backyard.</h2><p class="lead">Mills Smoke & Grill started with a simple frustration: too many seasonings disappear once the meat hits the heat. We are not simply selling products; we sell Selected Premium Products crafted to stay bold through smoke, searing and slow cooking.</p><a class="btn btn--primary" href="/shop">Taste the range <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14m-5-5 5 5-5 5"/></svg></a></div><div class="story-hero-image reveal reveal-delay-1"><img src="/assets/images/logo-bull.png" alt="Mills Smoke & Grill bull emblem"></div></div></section>
<section class="section section--paper"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">What the brand stands for</span><h2 class="display display--lg">Strong by design.</h2></div></div><div class="grid value-grid"><article class="value-card"><div class="value-card__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M13 3s1 4-2 7c-2-3-5-2-5 2 0 5 3 9 7 9s7-3 7-8c0-4-2-7-4-9 0 4-2 5-3 6 0-3 0-5 0-7Z"/></svg></div><h3>Built for heat</h3><p>Every recipe is designed to remain expressive after grilling, smoking or roasting.</p></article><article class="value-card"><div class="value-card__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="m12 2 1.8 6.2L20 10l-6.2 1.8L12 18l-1.8-6.2L4 10l6.2-1.8L12 2Z"/></svg></div><h3>Balanced layers</h3><p>Sweetness, salt, aromatics, smoke and spice work together instead of competing.</p></article><article class="value-card"><div class="value-card__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M12 3 4.5 6v5.5c0 4.8 3.2 8.2 7.5 9.5 4.3-1.3 7.5-4.7 7.5-9.5V6L12 3Z"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg></div><h3>Clear and trusted</h3><p>Simple pairings, heat indicators and instructions make every jar easy to choose and use.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">The process</span><h2 class="display display--lg">From idea to fire.</h2></div></div><div class="story-points" style="max-width:820px"><div class="story-point"><span class="story-point__number">01</span><div><h4>Choose the job</h4><p>Each blend begins with a clear purpose—brisket bark, crispy wings, bright seafood or versatile everyday seasoning.</p></div></div><div class="story-point"><span class="story-point__number">02</span><div><h4>Build the flavour architecture</h4><p>Base seasoning, aromatics, sweetness, smoke and heat are layered to perform across different cooking methods.</p></div></div><div class="story-point"><span class="story-point__number">03</span><div><h4>Test on real cooks</h4><p>Ratios are adjusted around crust, colour, moisture and finish—not just how the raw spice tastes.</p></div></div><div class="story-point"><span class="story-point__number">04</span><div><h4>Package it boldly</h4><p>The bull identity and dark smokehouse system create recognisable, premium shelf presence.</p></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section section--tight"><div class="container"><div class="newsletter"><div><span class="eyebrow" style="color:#280c02">The range is ready</span><h2 class="display display--md">Find your signature rub.</h2><p>Start with a single jar or build a full smokehouse shelf.</p></div><div><a class="btn btn--dark" href="/shop">Shop all products <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14m-5-5 5 5-5 5"/></svg></a></div></div></div></section>
